@title 2026 Engagement Survey Results
@subtitle Northwind Freight, shared with all staff

# Response
kpi Response rate | 79.4% | 842 of 1,060 employees
kpi Average favorable | 66.2% | up 1.2 points on 65.0% | good

842 of 1,060 employees responded to the 2026 engagement survey, a response rate of 79.4%.

# Results by statement
table = Statement,Favorable,Neutral,Unfavorable,Favorable in 2025; I understand how my work supports company goals,78%,15%,7%,76%; My manager gives me useful feedback,64%,22%,14%,61%; I have the tools I need to do my job,71%,18%,11%,70%; I see a path to grow here,49%,27%,24%,52%; I would recommend this company as a place to work,69%,20%,11%,66%

Growth is the lowest score at 49% favorable, and the only statement that fell, down 3 points from 52%. Its 24% unfavorable is the highest of the five.

# Change since 2025
data change = statement,change in favorable points; Understand work,2; Manager feedback,3; Tools,1; Growth path,-3; Recommend,3
chart hbar change labels title="Change in favorable score since 2025 (points)"

Manager feedback and recommendation each rose 3 points, and understanding of how work supports company goals rose 2 points.

# What we will do
step Publish the career framework | by 2027-02-28
